[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14640.389, "timestamp": "04:04:00", "text": "オーケー。 えっと、私の記憶が正しければ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14643.429, "timestamp": "04:04:03", "text": "ここで何かを受け取るはずです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14649.15, "timestamp": "04:04:09", "text": "あぁ、ああ、これ忘れてた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14654.5, "timestamp": "04:04:14", "text": "えっと、私の携帯電話はどこ？ これを手に入れなきゃ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14662.229, "timestamp": "04:04:22", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14679.03, "timestamp": "04:04:39", "text": "一つは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14682.6, "timestamp": "04:04:42", "text": "誰かと話したいから。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14693.429, "timestamp": "04:04:53", "text": "それで、私たちは何について話すのでしょうか？ 待って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14695.79, "timestamp": "04:04:55", "text": "私の"}]